{"completed": true, "response": "此时，温柔的期待还是占上风，只是心里那一点点不安也变得更具体了，开始在意这份靠近能不能如愿。因为之前只是想象彼此亲近，就已经让人感到温暖，所以这份期待也变得更加重要；越是在意，就越难不去担心最后会是什么结果。温柔依然在，只是多了一点牵挂。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "391dc1ff-9819-4ced-9572-83c9684ef63c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T004138029804Z", "elapsed_seconds": 7.266, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:41:45.297788+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "466c7cdbbae57a39878d49a144f569738b73e9270434b9c63da04f48d858698b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T004138029804Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "97f154e7093c7cc01cff3410356a1af5ca8